  "form_descriptions": [
    {
      "description": "Les formes ont différentes stats et talents. Fulguris change de forme quand le Miroir Sacré est utilisé sur lui.\n\nLe Miroir Sacré peut être obtenu en emmenant un Fulguris Avatar au Autel Abondance. (Fulguris peut être obtenu sous la Forme Totémique dans le RAdar Pokémon.)",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Forms have different stats and abilities.  Thundurus switches forms when the Reveal Glass is used on it.\n\nThe Reveal Glass may be obtained by taking a Therian Thundurus to Abundant Shrine.  (Landorus can be obtained in Therian Forme from the Dream Radar.)",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    }
  ],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les terres qu’il a survolées sont\nrecouvertes d’innombrables traces\ndes éclairs qu’il y a fait tomber.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Countless charred remains mar the\nlandscape of places through which\nThundurus has passed.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/17/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa queue lance des décharges\nélectriques. Il vole dans le ciel\nd’Unys et fait tomber des éclairs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The spikes on its tail discharge immense\nbolts of lightning. It flies around the\nUnova region firing off lightning bolts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/18/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As it flies around, it shoots lightning all\nover the place and causes forest fires.\nIt is therefore disliked.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "black-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/21/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "As it flies around, it shoots lightning all\nover the place and causes forest fires.\nIt is therefore disliked.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっぽの　トゲから　でんげきを\nうちだす。イッシュちほうの　そらを\nとびまわり　カミナリを　おとす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꼬리의 가시에서 전격을\n날린다. 하나지방의 하늘을\n날아다니며 번개를 내리친다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sa queue lance des décharges électriques. Il vole\ndans le ciel d’Unys et fait tomber des éclairs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es greift mit elektrischer Ladung aus den Dornen\nseiner Rute an und bombardiert Einall aus der Luft\nmit Blitzen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lanza descargas eléctricas por las púas de su cola.\nSobrevuela Teselia dejando caer rayos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lancia scariche elettriche dagli aculei della coda.\nVola per i cieli di Unima scagliando fulmini.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The spikes on its tail discharge immense bolts of\nlightning. It flies around the Unova region firing off\nlightning bolts.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "尻尾の　トゲから　電撃を\n撃ち出す。イッシュ地方の　空を\n飛び回り　雷を　落とす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lanza descargas eléctricas por las púas de su cola.\nSobrevuela Teselia dejando caer rayos.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "おおぞらを　とびまわりながら\nあちこちに　カミナリを　おとして\nやまかじを　おこすので　きらわれる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "넓은 하늘을 날아다니며\n여기저기 번개를 떨어뜨려\n산불을 내기 때문에 미움받는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vole dans le ciel d’Unys et fait tomber des éclairs,\nprovoquant des incendies qui font sa mauvaise\nréputation.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ist bei den Leuten verhasst, weil es auf seinen\nRundflügen immer wieder Blitze erzeugt,\ndie Waldbrände verursachen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Su gusto por surcar el cielo lanzando rayos y\nprovocando incendios forestales le ha granjeado\npocas simpatías.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Non è molto amato perché durante il suo peregrinare\nnei cieli fa cadere fulmini qua e là che causano incendi\nnei boschi.",
